{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天氣報告｜天晴炎熱　稍後部分時間多雲\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORECAST-261102-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】廣東沿岸風勢微弱，天色大致良好。本港地區今日天氣預測大致天晴，日間炎熱，市區最高氣溫約31度，新界再高一兩度。稍後部分時間多雲，有一兩陣微雨。吹輕微至和緩偏東風。</p><p>展望未來一兩日風勢較大。星期四部分時間有陽光。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:42.913568+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T23:02:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T03:18:31.815452+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:40.917146+00:00","content_hash":"d6cc7b14d0e35d92d0ced4b5fcc55dbf5d71f81d2dfe14856ac6dda4e40f0c79","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}